    "Official exact-family guide identifies the Factory bin directory and the unmodified merged image at0x0.",
    "Partial source-bounded digital simulation. Physical hardware, complete original factory applications and browser/WebGL acceptance are not claimed.",
    "Old8DI8RO has RS485, not C-revision CAN. TCA9554+PCF85063 SDA42/SCL41,DI4..11,RGB38wireRGB,buzzer46 and native SD48/47/45.",
